{"id":"n16231-5-5","stage":2,"title":"새다 · 漏","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16231-5-5-1","ko":"열심히 돈을 버는데도 왜 모인 돈이 하나도 없지?","zh":"明明那么努力赚钱，为什么攒的钱一点都没有啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"버는데도","meaning":"赚，挣","explanation":"벌다：赚，挣；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"벌다","audio":"/audio/0c2e9654aebad7fa3ddc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59096","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버는데도","audio":"/audio/37dfc98b0bbc4685bcf7.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"모인","meaning":"被积攒，被储存，被积蓄","explanation":"모이다：被积攒，被储存，被积蓄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"3","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모인","audio":"/audio/75406679877344cdcb8e.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseI